{"abstract":[{"text":"How keyboard input flows through TUIkit: from raw terminal bytes to your view handlers.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Input Types","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/QuitBehavior"],"anchor":"Input-Types"},{"title":"Focus","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusState","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Focusable"],"anchor":"Focus"},{"title":"Status Bar","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBar","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarItem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarItemProtocol","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Shortcut"],"anchor":"Status-Bar"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyboardShortcuts","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit uses a layered event dispatch system. When a key is pressed, it passes through up to five layers. The first layer that consumes the event wins: remaining layers are skipped. Layer 0 (text input) and Layer 3 (focus system) are mutually exclusive: when a text input element is focused, Layer 0 runs and Layer 3 is skipped."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"keyboard-event-dispatch.png"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Additionally, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Ctrl+C"},{"type":"text","text":" (SIGINT) is handled at the OS signal level "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"before","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" any of these layers: it always terminates the application."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Available Keys","anchor":"Available-Keys"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Key"},{"type":"text","text":" enum defines all keys that TUIkit can recognize from terminal input:"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Character Keys","anchor":"Character-Keys"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Any printable character is represented as ","type":"text"},{"code":".character(Character)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":[".onKeyPress(Key.from(\"x\")) {","    \/\/ handle \"x\" key","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Uppercase detection: when a capital letter is typed, the resulting "},{"code":"KeyEvent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" has "},{"code":"shift: true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" set automatically."}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Special Keys","anchor":"Special-Keys"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Key","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".escape"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Escape key","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".enter"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Enter \/ Return","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".tab"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tab"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".backspace","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Backspace \/ Delete backward"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".delete","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Forward delete","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Arrow Keys","anchor":"Arrow-Keys"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Key","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".up"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow up"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".down"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow down","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".left","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow left"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".right","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow right"}]}]]]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Navigation Keys","anchor":"Navigation-Keys"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Key","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Description","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".home"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Home"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".end","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"End","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".pageUp"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Page Up"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".pageDown"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Page Down"}]}]]]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Key Events and Modifiers","anchor":"Key-Events-and-Modifiers"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"code":"KeyEvent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" combines a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Key","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with modifier flags:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["public struct KeyEvent {","    public let key: Key","    public let ctrl: Bool     \/\/ Ctrl modifier","    public let alt: Bool      \/\/ Alt \/ Option modifier","    public let shift: Bool    \/\/ Shift modifier","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The terminal encodes modifiers differently from GUI frameworks:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ctrl+letter"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Detected from ASCII control codes (0x01–0x1A). For example, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Ctrl+C"},{"type":"text","text":" produces byte "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0x03"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Alt+key"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Detected from ESC prefix sequences (","type":"text"},{"code":"ESC","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" followed by the key byte).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shift"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Only auto-detected for uppercase letters. The terminal does not send distinct shift codes for most keys.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Registering Key Handlers","anchor":"Registering-Key-Handlers"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".onKeyPress()"},{"text":" modifier to handle keyboard events in your views:","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Handle All Keys","anchor":"Handle-All-Keys"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["Text(\"Press any key\")","    .onKeyPress { event in","        if event.key == .enter {","            doSomething()","            return true   \/\/ consumed: stops propagation","        }","        return false      \/\/ not consumed: passes to next handler","    }"]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Handle Specific Keys","anchor":"Handle-Specific-Keys"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["Text(\"Use arrow keys\")","    .onKeyPress(keys: [.up, .down]) { event in","        if event.key == .up { moveUp() }","        else { moveDown() }","        return true","    }"]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Handle a Single Key","anchor":"Handle-a-Single-Key"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The single-key variant always consumes the event:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["Text(\"Press Enter to continue\")","    .onKeyPress(.enter) {","        continueAction()","    }"]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Handler Priority","anchor":"Handler-Priority"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Handlers are dispatched in "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"reverse registration order","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the deepest view in the tree (most recently registered) gets the event first. This means inner views can intercept events before outer views see them."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["VStack {","    Text(\"Outer\")","        .onKeyPress(.enter) {","            \/\/ Only reached if inner handler did NOT consume it","            print(\"outer enter\")","        }","    Text(\"Inner\")","        .onKeyPress(.enter) {","            \/\/ Gets the event FIRST","            print(\"inner enter\")","        }","}"]},{"style":"important","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"All key handlers are re-registered every render frame. If a view is not rendered (e.g. behind a conditional), its handlers are not active.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Important"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Focus Navigation","anchor":"Focus-Navigation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FocusManager"},{"text":" dispatches key events in three steps:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Focused element delegation"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": the focused element’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"handleKeyEvent(_:)"},{"text":" is called first. If it consumes the event, dispatch stops.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tab \/ Shift+Tab"}]},{"type":"text","text":": cycles focus between elements (wraps around)."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow key fallback"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Up\/Left move to the previous element in the section, Down\/Right move to the next. This only triggers if the focused element did not consume the arrow key in step 1."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Action","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tab"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Move focus to the next focusable element (wraps around)","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shift+Tab"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move focus to the previous focusable element (wraps around)"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Up \/ Left","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Move to previous element in section (fallback)","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Down \/ Right","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move to next element in section (fallback)"}]}]]]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For more details, see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Default Bindings","anchor":"Default-Bindings"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Layer 4 provides three built-in key bindings that work without any configuration:"}]},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Action","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Condition"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Q"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Quit application"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only when "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/QuitBehavior"},{"type":"text","text":" allows it"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"t","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"T","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cycle to next color theme"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only when theme cycling is enabled"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"a","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"A","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cycle to next appearance"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Always active","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Quit Behavior","anchor":"Quit-Behavior"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/QuitBehavior","type":"reference"},{"text":" enum controls when ","type":"text"},{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is allowed to quit:","type":"text"}]},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Value","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Behavior"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".always"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" quits from any screen (default)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".rootOnly","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" only quits when no status bar context is pushed","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".rootOnly","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is useful for modal dialogs: push a status bar context for the dialog, and "},{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" will be blocked until the user dismisses it:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["Dialog(title: \"Confirm\") {","    Text(\"Are you sure?\")","} footer: {","    ButtonRow {","        Button(\"Yes\") { confirm() }","        Button(\"No\") { cancel() }","    }","}",".statusBarItems(context: \"confirm-dialog\") {","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"y\", label: \"yes\")","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"n\", label: \"no\")","}"]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Changing the built-in quit key","anchor":"Changing-the-built-in-quit-key"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default quit binding is configurable through "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarState\/quitShortcut","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["@Environment(\\.statusBar) private var statusBar","","statusBar.quitShortcut = .escape","statusBar.quitShortcut = .ctrlQ","statusBar.quitShortcut = QuitShortcut(","    key: .f12,","    shortcutSymbol: Shortcut.f12,","    label: \"exit\"",")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This changes both the Layer 4 quit binding and the displayed system item."}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Overriding `q` in a local view context","anchor":"Overriding-q-in-a-local-view-context"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A user-defined status bar item with shortcut "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"type":"text","text":" and an action intercepts the key before the default quit binding runs:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["EditorView()","    .statusBarItems {","        StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"q\", label: \"close\") {","            dismissEditor()","        }","    }"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the correct way to repurpose "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"type":"text","text":" for a specific screen, dialog, or focus section. The matching user item handles the event in Layer 1, so Layer 4’s built-in quit binding is never reached."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Status Bar Shortcuts","anchor":"Status-Bar-Shortcuts"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The status bar displays available shortcuts to the user. Use the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Shortcut","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" namespace for consistent, platform-standard symbols:"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Display Symbols","anchor":"Display-Symbols"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":[".statusBarItems {","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.arrowsUpDown, label: \"nav\")","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.enter, label: \"select\", key: .enter)","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.escape, label: \"back\")","}"]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Common Symbols","anchor":"Common-Symbols"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Symbol","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Constant"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⎋"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.escape"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Escape"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↵"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.enter"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Enter"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⇥"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.tab","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Tab","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"⇤","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.shiftTab"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Shift+Tab","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⌫"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.backspace"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Backspace"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⌦"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.delete"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Delete"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"␣"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.space","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Space","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"↑","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.arrowUp"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow up","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↓"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.arrowDown","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow down","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"←"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.arrowLeft"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow left","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"→"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.arrowRight"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow right"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↑↓"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.arrowsUpDown"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Vertical arrows","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"←→"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.arrowsLeftRight"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Horizontal arrows"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↑↓←→"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.arrowsAll","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"All arrows","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"⌃","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.control","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Control modifier","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⇧"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.shift","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shift modifier"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⌥"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.option"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Option \/ Alt","type":"text"}]}]]]},{"text":"Shortcut Helpers","anchor":"Shortcut-Helpers","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Combine modifier + key: \"⌃c\"","Shortcut.combine(.control, \"c\")","","\/\/ Ctrl+key display: \"^c\"","Shortcut.ctrl(\"c\")","","\/\/ Range display: \"1-9\"","Shortcut.range(\"1\", \"9\")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Common Shortcut Letters","anchor":"Common-Shortcut-Letters","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Constant","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Value","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.quit","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.yes"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"y"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.no","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"n"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.cancel"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"c","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.ok"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"o"}]}]]],"header":"row","type":"table"},{"text":"Automatic Key Matching","anchor":"Automatic-Key-Matching","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarItem","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" automatically derives the trigger key from the shortcut string when no explicit "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"key:"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter is given:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Symbol shortcuts ("},{"code":"⎋","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"↵","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"⇥","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") map to their corresponding "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Key"},{"type":"text","text":" values"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Single-character shortcuts ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"q\""},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"y\""},{"type":"text","text":") map to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".character(thatChar)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow combinations ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"↑↓\""},{"type":"text","text":") match "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"both"}]},{"type":"text","text":" individual arrow keys"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Multi-character non-symbol strings are informational only (no trigger key)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Automatic: shortcut \"q\" triggers on Key.character(\"q\")","StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"q\", label: \"quit\") { quit() }","","\/\/ Explicit: override the trigger key","StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.enter, label: \"select\", key: .enter) { select() }","","\/\/ Informational: no action, no trigger","StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.arrowsUpDown, label: \"nav\")"],"syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Status-Bar-Context-Stack","type":"heading","text":"Status Bar Context Stack","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The status bar supports a context stack for temporary shortcut overrides: useful for modals and nested navigation:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Set global items",".statusBarItems {","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.arrowsUpDown, label: \"nav\")","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.enter, label: \"select\", key: .enter)","}","","\/\/ Push context-specific items (e.g. for a dialog)",".statusBarItems(context: \"my-dialog\") {","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"y\", label: \"yes\") { confirm() }","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"n\", label: \"no\") { cancel() }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When a context is pushed, its items replace the global items in the display. System items (quit, theme, appearance) remain visible unless a user item uses the same shortcut string."}]},{"anchor":"System-Items","type":"heading","text":"System Items","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Three system items are shown by default:"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Shortcut","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Label"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Order","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Description","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"quit"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"900"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Quit the application","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"a"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"appearance","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"910","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cycle border appearance"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"t"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"theme"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"920","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cycle color theme"}]}]]]},{"type":"paragraph",